Restore the complete Asahi T6040 PCIe implementation.

Base: damsleth/m1n1 16b1f61fd2a995f855da8909411d06005d1e2b35
Source: https://github.com/AsahiLinux/m1n1/commit/0f221fc739afa52eecb9148f77c2d447f276456e
Only src/pcie.c changes, to exactly that upstream file. This removes the
obsolete operation-115 diagnostic and uses the T8132/T6040 BIT(4) PHY reset.
Wallace's July 29 V1 result and August 2 GL9755 test document this PCIe path.
The surrounding Wallace platform fixes, including the log-buffer guard,
remain on their pinned base. See docs/pcie-boot-fix.md for provenance.

